				<wikidot:authorName>Petrograd</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>455145</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Ok, so, Ty to MaliceAforethought, who gave me the title and is also an inspiration for keeping up the <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/task-forces-complete-list">MTF list</a>. (and also I took a sentence from it).<br /> Image is made of clipart from Pixabay, all edit: <a href="https://pixabay.com/service/license/">Pixabay license</a>, links below.</p> <p>I originally posted some of this data <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/forum/t-11130369/all-k-class-scenarios-used-in-scps">in the forums</a> after a few days procrastinating at work, manually pulling things from k-class-scenario tagges articles. I thought I would make it pretty.</p> <p>Also, please, anyone, have at!</p> <p>(And if you see anything missing or a wrong link or w/e&#8230; you don't have to ask to fix it. You can just edit it. :) )</p> 
				 	]]>
